  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize capturing the Nines. Since a single Nine is worth 9 points (more than an Ace and King combined), it is the most efficient way to build a lead.\n\nThe 'Part Two' Advantage: Use the first 13 tricks to identify which high cards your opponent is holding. In the second half, you will know exactly which suits they are void in.\n\nTrump Control: Save your 'Don' (5 of trumps) to capture an opponent's high-point Nine when they are forced to lead it or play it on a side-suit void.",
    Player: "Prioritize capturing the Nines. Since a single Nine is worth 9 points (more than an Ace and King combined), it is the most efficient way to build a lead.\n\nThe 'Part Two' Advantage: Use the first 13 tricks to identify which high cards your opponent is holding. In the second half, you will know exactly which suits they are void in.\n\nTrump Control: Save your 'Don' (5 of trumps) to capture an opponent's high-point Nine when they are forced to lead it or play it on a side-suit void.",
